    assumptions: ["Distinguish true correctness from verifier acceptance and specify false-positive/false-negative behavior on the changing policy distribution.", "Audits supply additional information; verifier scores alone are not assumed to identify false acceptances.", "Define the auditor error model, adaptive audit selection and the quantity controlled uniformly over training time; state overlap or exploration requirements."],
