    gap: "Safe exploration under GP regularity already identifies safely reachable regions. Deng and Juba give offline safe action-model learning under bounded stochastic support. The proposed extension is a sharp trajectory-risk frontier for online uncertainty and model error, not the first safe-learning algorithm.",
