    statement: "Fix a two-layer ReLU learner trained by T clipped, Gaussian-noised SGD steps on bounded labelled examples. After each release, an adversary chooses deletions using the releases seen so far. Determine the retained state and update work needed so that the joint transcript of subsequent model releases is (epsilon,delta)-indistinguishable from rerunning that same randomized learner on retained data, while preserving a specified prediction-risk tolerance. Count deletion number, dataset size, width and stored precision explicitly.",
